  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5bdaef56058eb5ac3a8ee3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初期回复耐力\\n之后在临近比赛终盘的位置\\n一段时间内速度少量提升\\n＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "124a5f843aeeb89abb07ba838e1c4179e0ef582c6566d587df5cc249ec5e2e1f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102303211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102303211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60a5fe905416930cb9be0182",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在中盘直线大幅回复体力",
      "source_fingerprint": "f49dbded22aa6acb840e20e84b9af7202adcaefbb98a62fe52f1bc91df6f4daa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102401111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102401111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5420e9ec89a8fb151e59de75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段时若前方堵塞\\n变得更擅长回避\\n并且稍微回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "63b94f404897508cd2a5d7830cdb02444b68045ab9fe6ad2952e61c579e2a62b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102401211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102401211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91f22ad64deb7c221b5b6158",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若前方堵塞\\n则速度稍微提升\\n并剥夺前方赛马娘的体力＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6aa9b5a0847586fefc396771bdb4857f2b6b8546764656e42d92a86e6dd2cb62",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102402111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102402111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce294c985fb0f8fdd62ee425",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以利落的动作过弯\\n大幅回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "126625a9be697ca6650d16aecf6b7b8c5b58a8f31a2447a7ed3f7baa8d04532c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102402211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102402211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e233548459c06570ad521e4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的直线若位于前三\\n则提升加速度,若此时为第一名\\n则消耗少量耐力将技能持续时间变为2倍\\n＜领放・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fcc6c713e6a5b836143d6ff511964f4178e2a22aeb26b57fab0af26fc56e043",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102403111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102403111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eab4ae6595840a54b1df5617",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘位于前方时\\n一段时间内速度少量提升\\n之后在最终直线稍微向前突进\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "445d33b9ba9fc69cc9bdeb23ee692a887b4139db090ea71ab490f3a97e0c4d50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102403211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102403211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e969cd5fe9688cb212148533",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n在直线上略微容易突围",
      "source_fingerprint": "1750b242f6d3edb6dc5e9cdbc86714c89bad1123bba29e952fdeb2d5879064c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10241"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/10241"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf2c36e34b37d6efd4db7895",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若位于中间集团之后\\n回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c38d6d8d7f48e6781319ef94b9d8920b6fb1eb579b8ef0dadada42b3e7446d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102501111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102501111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96c6b98a8145caa9606dd5aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n则稍微剥夺前方赛马娘的持久力\\n并稍微提升自己的速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f66fef462ca5a9aebb8bab00f3b800c666ae7b0c06c436028f76fa3c1edc94d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102501211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102501211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a760d6e963cf9c933b6f8e2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的直线上加速度提升\\n之后在最终直线处速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e54b9defd6ecf3a14d7fa7ef63b280db05a2a14bbc05173ff0ae61bb7956f7b8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102502111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102502111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50598c5d1bd124dcc8f8935b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘初段余力十足的话\\n向前迅速突进\\n＜追赶・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "79c1f9345cbcf4cf13d567375f7a7e0a3f41a1c0c3fea5e7dda0fb2511ddb8aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102502211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102502211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dae72e61866391576072058",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "进入最终弯道时向前突进\\n根据爬完上坡的次数\\n最多可增加4次效果时间\\n＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfa25d6b73eeb246d9a12cb69a942cb2fdaf7961befe7ecc40ade6b76df0c7b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102503111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102503111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7031348818928f626d113067",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "若处于最后冲刺中\\n则加速度大幅提升＜居中・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fa7370157c16c0ef41cacc1d11fc99b984b5bc504cb5ada40790647337dc61f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102503211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102503211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:103f52f5616a6ab977b60b17",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时,大幅提升加速力\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "857488fa451bef2f49fab1ac5e095a7e36c0b13b2ac300dcba8efdc24aaabf07",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102601111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102601111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74628e751bab1345662265c4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf9b07b1b8d3fa27783ba40d24cc62036333a5f2238e9815ec5fd3f0250ca2ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102601211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102601211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0370b1d3929235eb02804f9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则提升速度\\n并且稍微回复持久力＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fdd4c7b347c1308a4164307440bd019f57c0b7231c1c40a211483bf8bfb6b6e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102602111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102602111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59b175f6863fac9ad1b1a9b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "智力若有十二分高超,则临近\\n比赛终盘位于前方时,一段时间内\\n速度提升＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b849981c0459bf83e418abd32bf05fdd4ee7ac1edf008cd956d62216deeb6fe3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102602121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102602121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:070a843aa44b251e1d32204d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "起跑晚的时间小幅减少\\n并且所有基础能力稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b92e969dda006df8abc13abcb523c810c8a21ab53a6b2ed26094792d2f183e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102602211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102602211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b539651d4aa2fd57b1422a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ab865343e8d2cc7bb11ba21bb5f4c18a8900cd98590b35dbb75747988f7955f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102701111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102701111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71bb15d3c2406a570f5723c2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道时从外道完成超越时\\n速度大幅提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9c57f3c281bffe2f547b89b8104e230ee00825d1977986fbf1e0a116423d0d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102701211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102701211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f78b4982d6e71025a8322294",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身处下坡时,提升加速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4af60dd33afde7e5656e2d58d838386c60629d982e5ec7c1edd6a0f42e4be87e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102702111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102702111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fc0ac849458268708fe7be9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身处下坡时,速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "155a23095188637c0c9c48e70cc4b0bc0bd98834214feccb9d679a4673255b7f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102702211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102702211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf33bcd2beb4be0df8a71f3c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在下坡时一段时间内速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b6f03b421a406cb234693d5e34e36aaf4abecfae3a460e1d1e296447e0f1bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102702221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102702221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a696489def5ebbb9c146557",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的弯道中想要冲向前列时\\n提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "7020a63ff37e8a00ba918e07017c6fd8eea90784ca102e9e3f45761c3d08a717",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10271"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/10271"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b916cbfb026a134840e847cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时,一段时间内路线选择\\n变得更明智,小幅提升加速度\\n并且稍微提升速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "192417208823660333f6bbb41b1f74c30f1460e370c8cca7f7977596579e8552",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102801111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102801111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d60b7a2f7dc4fc8435a08ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时回复少量体力\\n一段时间内速度少量提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b5696515d56db87780aace21e284bedfc40ca521d6b75dbb78b7f9d4779ce20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102801211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102801211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6bd61955a7ff5133565430",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘消耗少量体力\\n使速度极大提升\\n＜先行・短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cb87c1940c7b6592455b8f94549bd376f8c979fd4b81df9af2d564b234a2ac1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102801221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102801221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50bd00070bd8a26458cc6828",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘速度会大幅提升\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed92d32868a71d005c4b070e722da806a67b4686553c5ca474f9410571bba1dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102802111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102802111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b35c2040f7107efd372a48c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘的初期位于前方时\\n加速力会提升，在短距离或英里\\n比赛中则会大幅提升＜作战·先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "13f0355873aaf40ee17ad7f9bb1120d63fb8670310ae92140546daf202c60b89",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102802211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102802211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5cc7b3f8b2f8c459444d743",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺阶段时若前方堵塞\\n则一段时间内加速度持续提升\\n路线的选择稍微变得明智",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f3e6add71490750985c4382d2922f0e7ba4d5f8e97a6c11439257ecc5de09f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102901111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102901111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:149e5d3fd8e314394f0a478c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身处下坡时\\n一段时间内加速度持续小幅提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0b7ac501fa3794043a17c209d8e88091e296edfe66782d007ba8ef411d151eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102901211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102901211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:468ef6debd7af1caf7c0d9f3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在下坡处加速度少量提升\\n并在比赛剩余300m之后速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "90a4b2f59b07db00acf511fa2d12b9294364d72babee25612fc8898dbb26876c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102901221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102901221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:148bdedb1d92fcfbe03661c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "286bca01bfae67bc12dab49130dda371ec7fc0254149faeaf977736cbfa24cf2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102902111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102902111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a527c4d7961316684c7532",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在弯道提升加速度\\n并稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f824c32a58b2c2a3e51e54fb5e380e693567e0bec5beb8a5c4173cc5413871d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102902211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102902211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5253999ef466a97308c8f8c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道提升加速度\\n若是草地比赛则一段时间内\\n提升加速度＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "108cbe81b17a108e27e675d61f6cf13a36eb463ff212bcf45b20e9067855d9e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "102902221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/102902221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b8a743b5e4ada8c73d943ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "处下坡时,加速度小幅提升\\n并稍微向前突进\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e86695e07af0b98e4f11e3c800245b03f117d8a6b3aac72fb49e80d21f1722ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103001111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103001111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488eed2a850a28dab7650283",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时回复持久力\\n并稍微提升速度＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "54b629ff3bf9a091a092da93367762a285a481370575d43162d70888b5f84e1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103001211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103001211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f9d12f4dcbc975cbb979d50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n回复持久力并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "008fd763915d4fedb7d146a371c687b06b27d3c23bce743b5df3eb0b618e1e50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103002111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103002111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b95a52ba61aa679de33246cd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n剥夺后方焦躁赛马娘的体力\\n并稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9aacb863cab1cc823eea3b3aade383fa0e711e77d1de17781373470a65559ab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103002211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103002211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:910078abf17348093c1a2fb5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半段的上坡提升加速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "77b3f6e61222c588b094addfa969c9ee21d871c779a93d243bbc1b77c002eaab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103003111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103003111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66ef47918d47c59ed423df4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "擅长在京都竞马场的比赛\\n速度、耐力和智力大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "90461cf76395a19a91f854e69f8ab07b8030e67ef0260f310e9c190a6c7d540c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103003211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103003211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aff6711ec48c65dd6c0df023",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身处上坡时回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "348d6a8724b079e0e32c7c7a270ad8307d8fa375b775bf5c65f63738644996f5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103101111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103101111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a5bf9dffaeecfaa875b2778",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方,则一段时间内\\n身后赛马娘的速度持续稍微下降\\n并提升自己的速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6034c43b9f029c49d7ab662bbe10bcf82d5d0bb3cf38e2a999fa8a7a79b61b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103101211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103101211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7608cd7ae3321166b2122efa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出闸时起跑晚的时间小幅缩短\\n并且所有基础能力微幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ed797cab576363817bacaf047f30ee1843298e38782dc56f032cb2b5f51a9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103102111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103102111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f15384394a7e07d1a3a996f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在弯道上速度提升\\n并且稍微提升加速度＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "931f23434624250844d2fa333998ee34336c87924d7310a9ed1783bb529ab2dc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103102211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103102211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60e25e0bec12f0591d0c9715",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出闸时加速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "5eab0693322d6094c90ded8fc6c68347e3e2711237c8c136fd3fb724474be0b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103103111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103103111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18fa97199d852fdf8b6166e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "长时间有紧跟在自己身后的马娘时\\n速度提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则额外稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e73c8bcc225444b3d8fd71c60c2d700619ea5a4d89ce80bf9eac8994ed716d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103103211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103103211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f0e4e165b761e7082ea7eba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "891bee704f1763d0b6bfcecc1b8342428d3b5538b8ef073ea9b12ccb9c775c13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103201111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103201111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34db6f3c410e930d4daf41fd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc9c411403cfc8cf437a4bfa8f7259f4f4b46748421e834b1d660d8fc2df04b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103201211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103201211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38e80e816a1f199b69065483",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "速度有十二分迅速时大幅提升速度\\n智力也十二分超群时极大提升速度\\n＜先行・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d584f099a5529c60e81a5a86ee92a79744d6d9d8e891959c84dae6eaf981bc38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103202111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103202111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d90f8dc368fc2cdd92d29ccf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度提升,并根据自身速度\\n提升技能效果\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b86593a8ec56a0643fe0aa7d631a4088a7eb46fd6b6e3709ab264b7c0429f58a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103202211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103202211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87f91b685fd34d906a5ac975",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时若位于前方\\n则速度提升,若是中距离比赛\\n则效果提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a00b542db962b25bade1f7e0a0323b9064ddd2658265abc9629451d80bc81e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103203111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103203111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:beaf9a636242656210202d08",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "周围有很多赛马娘时速度提升\\n且在2000m的比赛中变为速度大幅提升\\n并使除自身以外的队友速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc1c5d05cc451c501544bb251863d555d2f4dc32644cb80fc63df18b17363b94",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103203211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103203211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4471b180829fa9fbd52ee1f9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在比赛后半且靠近弯道时\\n持久力少量恢复\\n且短时间内稍微提高速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d71e9372407d3d38233cee2c37817273068261176e48c32e9e80cbea6a11c0a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10321"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/10321"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82d5a67ab1092511359f67c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧跟前方赛马娘时,回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bebdab9ce901dc1f4fa9a620c381b58ba0a33f610c6eeb3a5c772150b06981a8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103301111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103301111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b1e08b408a9c49d5f5a2881",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处后方\\n则在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n大幅提升速度＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c204360a6106aba30806fda2e15262603137f359730c3dc8a29c484dba5cdef6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103301211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103301211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84a620e9f9af34230250447e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于中后方时\\n速度大幅提升,若是2400m的比赛\\n则变为一段时间内速度大幅提升＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "93a304cde02d6bbcda32301daeaa298b1f243b10656ac50160b2030eec886e40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103302111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103302111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05f401cdf5193b4e6d2b329a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期大幅向前突进\\n若是2400m的比赛则一段时间内\\n大幅向前突进＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "54ae138daa59804cfd6a016e9f2d71e3b0bfc7a0ae4a863d5660d5cdc6d07974",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103302211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103302211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81c09c2bcfabf86b40812353",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若发动大量技能\\n则速度大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d072322a0b8ee1fa7313791f5f15187c5c92a46f2c7ca65e664d2b4fee5128",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103401111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103401111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2188fdc93681996f94f8a1d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n则大幅回复持久力\\n并且提升速度＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "da277804dfeb7250075faac315557a1bb13b026a6ad625e2393f3391c55245ce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103401211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103401211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22106117a480bcad1e01a4ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘处于后方时\\n回复少量体力并大幅提升速度\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "274b243f7b9bbefc8a4d69843ab3cd92c0cf6c938655934cd8535f32e36b2218",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103401221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103401221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3500e48c0b2cbfcc8deb185f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道上若身处内道\\n则速度大幅提升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "89d925b011d2bbf80541280ce7ae5760d29eea3c22e5e23c1e12d5a592191168",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103402111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103402111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f634fcdc7547603f707bd4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时若身处直线,大幅提升加速度\\n并且视野变得稍微广阔\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d99ea2be1643fb3369f4b884db27d00a3c9504efcff400af8d470b33cf7a9f51",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103402211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103402211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56469ffc5a215b2ad147b062",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终冲刺的直线上提升加速度\\n之后进入最终弯道时\\n稍微向前突进＜追赶・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "99ab5db118cab4fbbe2c1cf5c92fa0f89f40245bb550ac79bc3e2ac164c9d2d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103402221"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103402221"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb7b269e8d3e1374a24d81ab",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当成功完成超越时\\n一段时间内加速度持续小幅提升\\n并且速度稍微提升＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "71727dc48a8e6f721176f4653485708734d2c35c3799d9a2a9d1b77c0d08e378",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103501111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103501111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e394cdf80069d41640a5e9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处中间集团之后\\n则速度提升,并稍微回复持久力\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "749e7f86c59723d246bef07c3795af567bdeea27e02f51393e60c1b9074c6307",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103501211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103501211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00a9d0a626ffb46ba4d77d30",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身处上坡时,一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "158c1639014738ccf31fd6a929a823456dd61362a4d000a323d4e06f3338762b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103502111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103502111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dde0a4c6dfb0bd037692691",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在终盘的最终直线若处于好位置\\n一段时间内速度提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "65b41386c3c733ff3cc17726b2b48437fbcf808463678a7aac9122bd9c2e7d86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103502211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103502211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0745ac3a037d86db06f52eba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时位于第四名开外\\n则速度提升,若是东京比赛场的2400ｍ比赛\\n则速度大幅提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "864421772bb602be557f8e00fca2e2cb5817f2b516cc5a589ad9e45308f45812",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103503111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103503111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d0e58af081b9ae27f537ff9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于队伍中间时\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c8d0599b9f011f0a78afe57e2fc9425e1a23df648cb8ec8b8b9974d8456ea58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103503211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103503211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3e04838832179f1cb165c99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最终弯道之后进行名次争夺,在最终直线位于前方时\\n涌现出不服输的强烈求胜心\\n速度少量加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd02dfbda3ab103f9b34ca9e3a0400d45e2e3cd9ebe9cec21db1be8a647b3ad7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10351"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/10351"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b031b27c747bcb268a392f95",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处后方\\n则速度提升,并稍微回复持久力\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "da5459afc6480701748c22c66a75dd89755f6c993da2b4db17e27a109d8ff0e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103601111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103601111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5ad133377c71b81cf1da9cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身处直线时速度提升\\n并稍微向前突进\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd87c798ee6ec5a1b25194a601b289a2344e306f89d637e3ed476e8d3a0db4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103601211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103601211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35863eaa334a407f4d2d7c4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘回复体力\\n并削减前方最多5名赛马娘的体力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "714673acefcdaf733e3c5269728afd5520ecce67e781d72152e85dcc7d46a74b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103602111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103602111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4313f6fb8f23586a33aca141",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘在队伍中间被人超越时\\n向前突进,并削减前方最多5名赛马娘的体力＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c3e9d225d721d6ff150856924cd315010cef47ba429fbf016fdaa69336e1e77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103602121"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103602121"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974791724cc7a89669106aa5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于内侧的话\\n一段时间内速度上升＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b17583f5d2cfa47c167c3cdab943a46e399a29538dd8ee85f6d788e37292e150",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103602211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103602211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3242cee36a463678a3e5b298",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时赛道的选择变为更加明智\\n并且稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "99d3376b17848a555962e72c8755544b31ef223a3495129a6f750886f9a7976b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103701111"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103701111"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65af97c7efdb13129d172e8a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在最后冲刺阶段的关键时刻\\n大幅提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ef1367ad379297b65b5a3f95305740333f9fee9200162f51b5c7bd1d1f05d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "103701211"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/48/103701211"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdb48b37e4b5cadc114497cb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时一段时间内\\n持续向前突进＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ca777d535b3e490578c86dc54beabb5294d840297e187d3745a572507ca040",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
